  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening ACEU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With local chapters at 57 university and higher education institutions in all regions Asociaci&#xf3;n Colombiana de Estudiantes Universitarios (ACEU) is the biggest national student in Colombia. It was founded in 1998 and works with the politics of education, university democracy, human rights, and democratic liberties such as the right to assemble, organise and speak. The Programme focuses on gender equality in the higher education system, emphasizing both the rights of female students, and the rights of LGBTQIA+ learners, as well as inclusive curriculums comprising sexual and reproductive health rights for all genders.</narrative>
  </description>
